          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Bounded PHP primitive API or opaque signature-wrapper reference; generic keys remain unresolved. | migration_hint=Review the resolved primitive and purpose; PHP source alone does not establish loaded extensions, key type or active use. | next_actions=Introduce crypto abstraction boundary for algorithm agility (near-term)"
